{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/sarif-2.1/schema/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "fullName": "Trivy Vulnerability Scanner",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy",
          "name": "Trivy",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "DS-0001",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "':latest' tag used"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When using a 'FROM' statement you should use a specific tag to avoid uncontrolled behavior when the image is updated."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0001",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration DS-0001\nType: Dockerfile Security Check\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nCheck: ':latest' tag used\nMessage: Specify a tag in the 'FROM' statement for image 'gcr.io/distroless/static'\nLink: [DS-0001](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0001)\nWhen using a 'FROM' statement you should use a specific tag to avoid uncontrolled behavior when the image is updated.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration DS-0001**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Dockerfile Security Check|MEDIUM|':latest' tag used|Specify a tag in the 'FROM' statement for image 'gcr.io/distroless/static'|[DS-0001](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0001)|\n\nWhen using a 'FROM' statement you should use a specific tag to avoid uncontrolled behavior when the image is updated."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "DS-0026",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "No HEALTHCHECK defined"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "You should add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your docker container images to perform the health check on running containers."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0026",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration DS-0026\nType: Dockerfile Security Check\nSeverity: LOW\nCheck: No HEALTHCHECK defined\nMessage: Add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your Dockerfile\nLink: [DS-0026](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0026)\nYou should add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your docker container images to perform the health check on running containers.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration DS-0026**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Dockerfile Security Check|LOW|No HEALTHCHECK defined|Add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your Dockerfile|[DS-0026](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0026)|\n\nYou should add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your docker container images to perform the health check on running containers."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "LOW"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "KSV-0003",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The container should drop all default capabilities and add only those that are needed for its execution."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0003\nType: Helm Security Check\nSeverity: LOW\nCheck: Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all\nMessage: Container 'grype-db' of Deployment 'harbor-scanner-grype-harbor-scanner-grype' should add 'ALL' to 'securityContext.capabilities.drop'\nLink: [KSV-0003](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003)\nThe container should drop all default capabilities and add only those that are needed for its execution.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0003**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Helm Security Check|LOW|Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all|Container 'grype-db' of Deployment 'harbor-scanner-grype-harbor-scanner-grype' should add 'ALL' to 'securityContext.capabilities.drop'|[KSV-0003](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003)|\n\nThe container should drop all default capabilities and add only those that are needed for its execution."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "2.0",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "LOW"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "KSV-0125",
              "name": "Misconfiguration",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Restrict container images to trusted registries"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Ensure that all containers use images only from trusted registry domains."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0125",
              "help": {
                "text": "Misconfiguration KSV-0125\nType: Helm Security Check\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nCheck: Restrict container images to trusted registries\nMessage: Container grype-db in deployment harbor-scanner-grype-harbor-scanner-grype (namespace: default) uses an image from an untrusted registry.\nLink: [KSV-0125](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0125)\nEnsure that all containers use images only from trusted registry domains.",
                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV-0125**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Helm Security Check|MEDIUM|Restrict container images to trusted registries|Container grype-db in deployment harbor-scanner-grype-harbor-scanner-grype (namespace: default) uses an image from an untrusted registry.|[KSV-0125](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0125)|\n\nEnsure that all containers use images only from trusted registry domains."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "misconfiguration",
                  "security",
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "version": "0.76.2"
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "DS-0001",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Artifact: Dockerfile\nType: dockerfile\nVulnerability DS-0001\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nMessage: Specify a tag in the 'FROM' statement for image 'gcr.io/distroless/static'\nLink: [DS-0001](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0001)"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "Dockerfile",
                  "uriBaseId": "ROOTPATH"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 21,
                  "startColumn": 1,
                  "endLine": 21,
                  "endColumn": 1
                }
              },
              "message": {
                "text": "Dockerfile"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "DS-0026",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Artifact: Dockerfile\nType: dockerfile\nVulnerability DS-0026\nSeverity: LOW\nMessage: Add HEALTHCHECK instruction in your Dockerfile\nLink: [DS-0026](https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ds-0026)"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
